{"data":{"codec":"utf8","content_ref":"inline:SRC_002 (Implicit Induction) and SRC_005 (Verisimilitude) are in CONTRADICTION regarding the source of normative force. Kind: Contradiction. REFUTED IF: One can show that 'closeness to truth' (verisimilitude) inherently presupposes the 'uniformity of nature' (induction), thereby collapsing SRC_005 into SRC_002 and removing the contradiction.","id":"48c3c82d50ef16323ed98ac3e9dc5a0e04448d9339d2c5b6fc2d666273fd9763","interface":{"commitments":["hv-floor@2a45b7988522","lineage-ref@f062e59fd928","relation-form@578e42df713e"],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"15adc71678331108a100df74736f0137c90bcd4632e9861aadbb5b03c1583a93"},{"role":"dependence","target":"353f407b1d776de5303715a74fc26f6e762ad0db15c29200e2f10c60d0663a68"},{"role":"dependence","target":"445582b994961869eaa0c8b9e00620543302f4b6c08915d70d9b80596530a23b"},{"role":"dependence","target":"5d06de1836f586c4ff2106559e87e6dc0b307c1b85cbfb4041be8b3ecebb9840"},{"role":"dependence","target":"8b902069cd4a92545af148d740eca1bdcf7a116e7075a9e67f139514642b6337"}]},"provenance":{"event_seq":565,"role":"conjecturer","school":"school-0"},"warrants":[]},"id":"48c3c82d50ef16323ed98ac3e9dc5a0e04448d9339d2c5b6fc2d666273fd9763","schema":"artifact"}